---
import:
  - stdlib/lang/java
  - stdlib/library/common
description: A library in Java 21, built with Maven into one jar.
---

***implementation reqs***

- :Implementation: builds with Maven through the Maven wrapper, from `pom.xml`, into one jar, and depends only on `slf4j-api` for logging.
- :Implementation: keeps its public API in one package, and everything else in an `internal` package under it.
- :Implementation: defines its exceptions under one base class `<Library>Exception`.
- :UnitTests: run with `./mvnw test`.
